OL,3,APassengers sleep on floors and describe
OL,4,Aairport 'carnage' as hundreds more
OL,5,Aflights cancelled
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We're exhausted," one family tell us
OL,8,Fafter spending the night trying to
OL,9,Freach Manchester; another passenger
OL,10,Fdescribes "carnage" at Gatwick baggage
OL,11,Freclaim after his flight to Lanzarote
OL,12,Fwas cancelled
OL,14,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,15,Fhas apologises for the issue - the
OL,16,Ffirm's boss Martin Rolfe says there
OL,17,Fwill be an investigation
OL,19,FRole's due to meet Transport Secretary
OL,20,FHeidi Alexander later - she's expected
OL,21,Fto tell MPs a cyber attack was
OL,22,F"categorically" not the cause
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
